From 5267f10bdd9a1eaf1722bf60f7f90832899f96c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VenZ9 <191755948+VenZ9@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:52:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand Fold Craft Launcher to OrbitX Launcher

Rename the Android app, switch the default theme to orbit crimson,
replace launcher icons, point about/update URLs at this fork, and
use /OrbitX as the shared game directory. Java packages stay
com.tungsten.fcl for upstream compatibility. applicationId is now
com.orbitx.launcher.
